    "-1000000000 <= cost <= 1000000000",
    "Finite cheapest costs lie in[-299000000000,299000000000]",
    "Output strings are decimal costs, UNREACHABLE or UNBOUNDED"
  ],
  "interface": "Solution.solve(n,edges) returns String[] / vector<string> / list[str].",
